# {{ site.name }}

> {{ site.description }}

Web development studio based in {{ site.city }}, Oregon, run by Jeremy Caldwell (20 years building websites and web applications). Serves small and local businesses in Sutherlin, Roseburg and across Southern Oregon. Every engagement starts with a free audit: a Scouting Report (score out of 100, top three issues and a comparison with two local competitors) for businesses with a website, or a look at local competition on Google for those without one. The SEO Growth Starter includes a full Scorecard audit with a prioritized fix list. The three steps: Scouting Report (free, where you stand), Scorecard (in-depth audit, what to fix), Box Score (monthly client dashboard, what the work brings in). Prices are listed on the Services page.

## Services

- [SEO Growth Starter]({{ site.url }}/services/#seo): One-time setup to get a business on Google the right way: Google Business Profile, Analytics, Search Console, keyword research and an SEO roadmap.
- [Ongoing SEO]({{ site.url }}/services/#ongoing-seo): Monthly retainer, priced in the free audit. Each month Line Drive Digital does the top items from the client's Box Score fix list (service and location pages, Google Business Profile upkeep), runs a fresh Scorecard, and reports what the work brought in.
- [Website management]({{ site.url }}/services/#websites): Design, build, hosting and content updates, monthly or as a one-time build (content updates included on the monthly plan, billed as needed on the one-time build). Every website client gets Box Score, a private client dashboard refreshed daily: leads (forms, website calls, Google profile calls), search rankings, traffic sources including AI assistants, site speed and health, a monthly Scorecard, and a ranked list of what to do next.
- [Custom apps & AI tools]({{ site.url }}/services/#apps): Workflow reviews, quick automations and custom apps built around how a business already works.

